query bobjane is:
    the winner of testgame is which player.

query hypothetical is:
    the winner of which game is bob.

query who_wins is:
    the winner of which game is which player.

query which_the_winner_of_is is:
    the winner of which game is which player.

the view the act is:
    the title is "Rock Paper Scissors Act, as Blawx encodes it".
    the case is a scenario, with the documents it is stated in.
    the facts about "the case" are
        a game is a game,
        a player is a player,
        a player played in a game,
        a player threw a sign in a game.
    the result is the answer to query which_the_winner_of_is.
    the result shows its reasons.
    the result shows its citations.
    the result can be flipped.

